# .dockerignore for MeetingSummarizer.Api
# Exclude build artifacts and unnecessary files from Docker context

# .NET build artifacts
**/bin
**/obj
**/out
**/.vs
**/.vscode

# Package files
*.nupkg
*.snupkg

# Node.js (if any frontend build tools)
**/node_modules
**/npm-debug.log
**/yarn-error.log

# IDE and OS files
**/.idea
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Git and version control
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes

# Docker files (avoid recursion)
**/Dockerfile*
**/.dockerignore
**/docker-compose*

# Documentation and logs
**/README*.md
**/LICENSE
**/*.log

# Test results and coverage
**/TestResults
**/coverage
**/*.trx
**/*.coverage
**/*.coveragexml

# Temporary files
**/tmp
**/temp
**/.tmp

# Azure and deployment
**/azure-infrastructure
**/.azure
**/arm-templates

# Sample files (not needed in production)
**/sample-audio-files
**/sample-video-files

# Frontend build dependencies (but not the source code)
**/frontend/node_modules
**/frontend/.vite
**/frontend/dist

# Environment and config files that shouldn't be in container
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Local.json